  "_comment": "M5 两阶段敏感性协议。stage=screen: 3任务x20episodes 粗筛 (~16 配置, ~8h); stage=final: 10任务x50episodes 决赛 (~10 配置, ~20h)。quant_target 支持 nvfp4|mxfp4(不支持,仅记录)|fp8|bf16|mixed。",
